log_every_console=1000 log_every_file=500

# Legend (all values are averaged over each file window)
# Summary.avg_reward: mean episode reward in the window.
# Summary.avg_steps: mean episode steps in the window.
# Summary.avg_births: mean births per episode in the window.
# Summary.avg_deaths: mean deaths per episode in the window.
# Summary.lr: optimizer learning rate at log time.
# Summary.difficulty: curriculum difficulty factor (0..1).
# Summary.tick: last tick observed in the window.
# Summary.pop: population at the last tick in the window.
# Scenario mix.<name>: scenario counts and share within the window.
# Stockpile.avg: mean of stockpile ratios across resources.
# Stockpile.min: minimum stockpile ratio across resources.
# Stockpile.<resource>: current/target ratio per resource.
# Nodes.<resource>: remaining/total capacity ratio per resource node.
# Needs.<need>: average need value (0..1).
# Housing.houses: total houses.
# Housing.beds: total bed capacity.
# Housing.ratio: beds/population ratio.
# Housing.unsheltered: fraction of population without beds.
# Reproduction.ticks: ticks accumulated in the window.
# Reproduction.couples_per_tick: average couples per tick.
# Reproduction.fertile_per_tick: average fertile adults per tick.
# Reproduction.pregnancies_per_tick: average pregnancies per tick.
# Reproduction.cooldowns_per_tick: average cooldowns per tick.
# Reproduction.chance: average conception chance per tick.
# Reproduction.resource_factor: average resource factor for conception.
# Reproduction.crowding_factor: average crowding factor for conception.
# Reproduction.morale_factor: average morale factor for conception.
# Reproduction.season_factor: average season factor for conception.
# Reproduction.attempts: average attempts per episode.
# Reproduction.successes: average successes per episode.
# Reproduction.blocked.<reason>: average blocked counts per episode.
# Merchant.trades_per_tick: average trades per tick.
# Merchant.given_per_tick.<resource>: average units given per tick.
# Merchant.received_per_tick.<resource>: average units received per tick.
# Fields.nodes: count of field nodes.
# Fields.node_ratio: remaining/total capacity ratio for field nodes.
# Fields.water_ratio: water stockpile ratio used for irrigation.
# Fields.irrigation: irrigation multiplier.
# Fields.season: seasonal multiplier applied to field regen.
# Fields.regen: irrigation * season multiplier.
# Signals.critical_needs: fraction of dwarves at critical needs.
# Signals.idle_adults: fraction of idle adults.

